# Local: DATABASE_URL or DB_HOST, DB_PORT, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, DB_NAME
# Vercel + Render: set DATABASE_URL = Render External (or Pooler) URL. DB name on Render = jobzenter_db.

# One-time migration (create contact_messages table on Render without pgAdmin):
# 1. In Vercel: Environment Variables → Add MIGRATE_SECRET = any random string (e.g. mySecretKey123)
# 2. Redeploy, then open in browser: https://jobzenter.in/api/admin/migrate-contact?key=mySecretKey123
# 3. After success, remove MIGRATE_SECRET from Vercel if you want (optional).
